Theorem call_access:forall m bo br bv po pr pv f v,
 bo<>br->bo<>bv->br<>bv->writable12 m bo po->Reads m br pr 9 f->Reads m bv pv 3 v->
 exists mf,state_eval Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args bo br bv po pr pv)m)=Some(Vundef,mf) /\
 (forall ch b ofs p,Mem.valid_block m b->Mem.valid_access m ch b ofs p->Mem.valid_access mf ch b ofs p).
Proof.
 intros m bo br bv po pr pv f v OR OV RV W RM RI.
 destruct(call_access_summary m bo br bv po pr pv f v OR OV RV W RM RI)as[mf[EV[BYTES[FRAME[WRITE ACCESS]]]]].
